  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>P</mi></math> be a plane passing through the points <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and R be any point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> .Then the image of <math><mi>R</mi></math> in the plane <math><mi>P</mi></math> is",
